        "Let's follow the end. Sam Houston\'s army retreated east for weeks, then turned and attacked at San Jacinto on April 21, 1836. The battle lasted eighteen minutes. The Mexican president, Santa Anna, was captured, and Texas was free.\n[[April 21, 1836: San Jacinto.]]",
